# Keep secrets and local noise out of the Docker build context.
# Without this, `COPY . /app` would bake .env (and the OpenRouter API key)
# into the image layer. See Dockerfile + specs/_meta.md (safety constraints).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.git
.github
.venv
__pycache__
*.pyc
.pytest_cache
*.pdf
